MOG CITY: Unfinished Business. Notices and credits
==========================================

All names, companies and events in Mog City are fictional (JPBank and Blimpco included); nobody in
the game is based on a real person.

Slop New York
-------------
The city this game is built on is Slop New York by Mr.doob, under the MIT License (see LICENSE).
Some city code is ported from Slop New York's newer commits by Mr.doob, under the same MIT License
(see LICENSE); each ported part names its commit in a short header comment.


