Bandai Namco Research Motion Dataset (motion capture)
----------------------------------------------------
Motion data: Bandai Namco Research Motion Dataset, (c) 2022 Bandai Namco Research Inc., CC BY-NC 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/; https://github.com/BandaiNamcoResearchInc/Bandai-Namco-Research-Motiondataset).
These files are NOT covered by the MIT License in LICENSE; they remain under CC BY-NC 4.0: they may be used and
shared for non-commercial purposes only, with this credit. The licence's text is in assets/anim/bandai/LICENSE.txt.
They were changed: retargeted from the dataset's BVH files to this game's rigs (thug.glb's, dan.glb's, fiona.glb's,
gears.glb's and the city's walkers'), trimmed to loops, their travel taken out (in place) and their feet set on the
ground; the Suits' standing idle is one short stand from the dataset played forward then back at half speed, Fiona's
and Gears' idles one standing frame held with breathing added; in the game Dan's steps play on his legs alone, under
his guard. In suits.glb the fingers are also eased from the capture's near-fist toward a relaxed hand (a soft curl,
the index least and the little finger most), and in the standing idles the upper arms are turned in to hang at the
sides (28 Oct 2026).
  - assets/anim/bandai/suits.glb: the Suits' standing idle, walks, run, sprint, side-steps, back-step, a "this way"
    gesture and two wave-offs (dataset-1: call, walk, run, dash, walk-back, walk-left, walk-right, guide, bye,
    byebye; normal and masculinity styles)
  - assets/anim/bandai/rally-crowd-ped.json: the rally crowd's dances and cheers (dataset-1: dance-long,
    dance-short, normal; dataset-2: wave-both-hands, raise-up-both-hands, wave-right-hand; active, youthful)
  - assets/anim/bandai/dan-footwork.glb: Dan's step forward, back-pedal and side-steps in a fight (dataset-1:
    walk, walk-back, walk-left, walk-right)
  - assets/anim/bandai/fiona-moves.glb, gears-moves.glb: Fiona's and Gears' standing idles (dataset-1: bow, its
    first frame) and Fiona's run (dataset-1: dash, masculinity style); Gears' talk keeps its arms from his CMU talk
    (see Characters below), over the idle's legs


