Characters (assets/characters)
------------------------------
  - dan.glb, gears.glb, jane.glb, fiona.glb: original characters made for Mog City (invented people;
    nobody is modelled on a real person), built from MakeHuman's base body, clothes and hair
    (http://www.makehuman.org, CC0-1.0; Jane from GameMog's CC0 MakeHuman people pack), then shaped,
    dressed, recoloured and texture-baked for the game. Gears' beard and cap, Fiona's megaphone and
    shades and the Suits' glasses and earpieces are made in code.
  - Their walk, idle, talk, phone and similar clips come from the CMU Graphics Lab Motion Capture
    Database (http://mocap.cs.cmu.edu), which Carnegie Mellon University provides free for all uses:
    it may be included in products, but the data itself may not be resold. The database was created
    with funding from NSF EIA-0196217.
  - Dan's freeflow fight moves (the ff* clips) are Spiderbench's, retargeted to his rig (see
    Spiderbench above).


